  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 2011, while a diving team was looking at a strange object on the floor of the Baltic Sea, warships from several NATO countries were sitting around them. Dennis Asberg, a Swedish treasure hunter who led the expedition, tells Michels he saw this himself: \"It was French and German and American and British ships around us.\" If true, it would suggest that militaries were watching closely whatever the divers had found."
